repository-code: 'https://github.com/m-machala/OpenCellLab-Simulator/'
abstract: >-
  OCL is a cellular automata simulator written in python
  using a modular architecture allowing it to simulate a
  vast number of CA configurations through the use of
  user-created modules. Its focus is to make this modular
  system easy to use and for the modules to be easy to
  create and share. 
keywords:
  - cellular automata
  - CA
